+## [0.6.0-2022.15] - Local candidate
+
+- Support typed command results, structured failures and terminal logs in attached and detached execution.
+- Keep cooperative cancellation scoped to the originating job across async continuations.
+- Enforce the async eval timeout while the Editor's synchronization context is paused.
+
 ## [0.6.0-2022.14] - Local candidate

 - Add offline non-GPU counter discovery, statistics and per-frame values in native units.
